<title>UK: DT Schiffsbank AG sets 100 mln mark Dec 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>DT Schiffsbank AG sets 100 mln mark Dec 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager SGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE SCHIFFSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.875    MATURITY  **27.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  99.90     PAY DATE  S-27.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST THREE MONTHS THEN STEPS UP TO 5.125 PCT</p>
<p>		 THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     **CALL AT PAR FROM 27.DEC.96</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    BREMEN    DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
